From 4e1b3b786c13089cef6e17d195d5aca7265d373a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yaegerbomb42 <yaeger.james42@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 13:54:41 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(httpguard): http-guard + MCP transport

Adds lib/http-guard.ts (auth, per-user TokenBucket rate limit before body
parse, bounded JSON 64 KB, validate callback, no-store) and lib/mcp/transport.ts
(JSON-RPC 2.0 / MCP 2024-11-05, single+batch <=20, notifications -> 202,
error codes, 413 over 256 KB), wired into both swarm-board and memory MCP
routes via McpServerAdapter.

Reconciled the swarm-board POST hunk against the live base (which had added
a JSON-RPC params/id validation block); the new transport validates id
globally, so the invalid-id case now returns -32600 (stricter behavior).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
